(empty) No parts are compiled into this build of radar. Each part is a cargo feature: build radar with the ones you want (cargo build --features <part>).
── detail · about ──
:empty: A part is one ability of radar, usually one tool it works with, compiled in as a cargo feature. Parts never depend on each other: each works alone, and each one present adds to the others.
